  // Article Body
  section.page-section
    .container.px-4.px-lg-5
      .row.justify-content-center
        .col-lg-8

          // TL;DR
          .card.border-0.bg-light.p-4.mb-4
            h5.fw-bold TL;DR / Key Takeaways
            ul.mb-0
              li 
                strong Immediate Help:
                |  Call 911 for overdoses; the Good Samaritan Law protects you.
              li 
                strong Fentanyl requires medical detox:
                |  Quitting "cold turkey" is dangerous and often leads to rapid relapse.
              li 
                strong Rapid MAT Access:
                |  "Bridge Clinics" in Spokane offer same-day Suboxone/MAT initiation.
              li 
                strong Comprehensive Support:
                |  Long-term success requires combining MAT with therapy and peer support.

          // Quick Definition & ToC
          h2.mt-2 Quick Definition
          p.lead
             |  Comprehensive 
             strong fentanyl addiction treatment Spokane
             |  involves a multi-step recovery process starting with immediate harm reduction (Narcan), medically supervised detox to manage withdrawals, and rapid access to Medication-Assisted Treatment (MAT).

          .mb-5.p-4.bg-light.rounded
            h4.h5 Table of Contents
            ul.list-unstyled.mb-0
              li.mb-2: a(href="#harm-reduction") Step 1: Harm Reduction & Legal Safety
              li.mb-2: a(href="#detox") Step 2: Medical Detox & Withdrawal Management
              li.mb-2: a(href="#mat") Step 3: Medication-Assisted Treatment (MAT) & Bridge Clinics
              li.mb-2: a(href="#recovery-path") Step 4: Long-Term Recovery (IOP & Residential)
              li.mb-2: a(href="#dual-diagnosis") Step 5: Dual Diagnosis & Mental Health
              li.mb-2: a(href="#comparison") Treatment Comparison Table
              li.mb-2: a(href="#mistakes") Common Recovery Mistakes
              li.mb-2: a(href="#faq") Frequently Asked Questions
              li.mb-0: a(href="#conclusion") Take Your Next Step

          hr.my-5

          // Intro
          p In Spokane, the rise of synthetic opioids has made finding the right 
            strong fentanyl addiction treatment Spokane
            |  services more urgent than ever. Whether you are seeking help for yourself or a loved one, Spokane has a robust network of clinics, detox centers, and peer advocates dedicated to helping people reclaim their lives from fentanyl.
          
          .alert.alert-danger.mt-4
            strong
              i.bi.bi-exclamation-triangle-fill.me-2
              | Call 911 right now if someone is overdosing.
            |  Help is on the way. Use Narcan if you have it. Washington law protects you when you call for help.

          h2#harm-reduction.mt-5
            i.bi.bi-shield-shaded.text-primary.me-2
            | 1. Harm Reduction & Legal Safety (RCW 69.50.315)
          
          p Survival is the first step of recovery. Before treatment can begin, you must be equipped with the tools to prevent a fatal overdose.
          
          ul
            li 
              strong Free Narcan in Spokane:
              |  Obtain no-cost Narcan at the Spokane Regional Health District (SRHD) or through mobile outreach teams. Many local pharmacies also provide it via a state standing order.
            li 
              strong The Good Samaritan Law:
              |  Under Washington law, you and the person overdosing cannot be charged with drug possession when you call 911 for medical assistance. 
              strong Never hesitate to call for help.
            li 
              strong Fentanyl Testing Strips:
              |  Available for free at SRHD and various harm reduction sites to help identify the presence of fentanyl in other substances.

          h2#detox.mt-5
            i.bi.bi-shield-check.text-primary.me-2
            | 2. Medical Detox & Withdrawal Management
          
          p Fentanyl withdrawal is notoriously grueling. The physical dependency is so strong that most people cannot quit "cold turkey" without medical intervention.
          
          ul
            li 
              strong Why it matters:
              |  Supervised detox provides comfort medications (like Lucemyra or clonidine) to manage the intense bone pain, anxiety, and nausea.
            li 
              strong Local Spokane Options:
              |  Facilities like STARS, Royal Life Centers, and Inland Northwest Behavioral Health provide 24/7 medical monitoring.
            li 
              strong Critical Timing:
              |  Wait times can vary, so it is important to contact a facility as soon as the "window of willingness" opens.

          h2#mat.mt-5
            i.bi.bi-capsule-pill.text-primary.me-2
            | 3. Medication-Assisted Treatment (MAT) & Bridge Clinics
          
          p For many, MAT is the "gold standard" of 
            strong fentanyl addiction treatment Spokane
            | . It stabilizes brain chemistry and removes the debilitating hunger for the drug.
          
          ul
            li 
              strong Bridge Clinics:
              |  Spokane features "Bridge Clinics" at Providence and CHAS Health designed for rapid induction. They can often start you on Suboxone or Methadone the same day you walk in.
            li 
              strong Maintenance Meds:
              |  Long-term options include Suboxone (buprenorphine), Methadone, or Vivitrol (a once-a-month injection that blocks the high entirely).
            li 
              strong E-E-A-T Note:
              |  Clinical studies show that MAT combined with therapy reduces overdose deaths by over 50%.

          h2#recovery-path.mt-5
            i.bi.bi-house-heart.text-primary.me-2
            | 4. Long-Term Recovery: Residential & Outpatient
          
          p Once stable, the work of healing the mind begins. Spokane offers various levels of care to fit your life situation.
          
          ul
            li 
              strong Residential Treatment:
              |  30–90 day programs like those at TRIUMPH provide a safe environment away from triggers.
            li 
              strong Intensive Outpatient (IOP):
              |  Allows you to attend therapy while living at home or in 
              a(href="/blog/sober-living-housing-spokane.html") Spokane sober living housing
              | .
            li 
              strong Peer Support:
              |  Connection is the opposite of addiction. Join local NA, AA, or SMART Recovery groups to build a sober network.

          h2#dual-diagnosis.mt-5
            i.bi.bi-infinity.text-primary.me-2
            | 5. Dual Diagnosis & Mental Health
          
          p Many people in Spokane use fentanyl to numb underlying trauma, depression, or anxiety. Effective treatment must address both.
          
          ul
            li 
              strong Integrated Care:
              |  Seek providers who offer dual-diagnosis services, treating the addiction and mental health concurrently.
            li 
              strong Trauma-Informed Therapy:
              |  Essential for addressing the "why" behind the drug use to prevent future relapses.

          hr.my-5

          // Best Practices
          h2.mt-5
            i.bi.bi-star-fill.text-warning.me-2
            | Best Practices That Actually Move the Needle
          
          h3.h5.mt-4 The Post-Detox Plan
          p Never leave a detox bed without a verified next step. A massive percentage of overdoses occur immediately after detox when tolerance is lowest. Always have a "warm handoff" directly to an inpatient or IOP facility.

          .alert.alert-info.mt-4
            h4.alert-heading
              i.bi.bi-info-circle-fill.me-2
              | Expert Note: Apple Health Coverage
            p.mb-0 Apple Health (Medicaid) covers all levels of care for fentanyl treatment in Washington State—from detox to residential to outpatient. If you are uninsured, Spokane clinics have financial navigators to help you enroll immediately.

          hr.my-5

          // Comparison Table
          h2#comparison.mt-5
