                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse2")
                  | Is Narcan free in Spokane?
              #faqCollapse2.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby="faqHeading2" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body
                  | Yes. You can get Narcan at no cost at the Spokane Regional Health District (SRHD), many local pharmacies via the state's standing order, and through various harm reduction programs.

            .accordion-item
              h2.accordion-header#faqHeading3
                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse3")
                  | What is the Washington Good Samaritan Law?
              #faqCollapse3.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby="faqHeading3" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body
                  | Washington’s Good Samaritan Law protects both the caller and the victim from drug possession charges when calling 911 for a medical emergency like an overdose.

            .accordion-item
              h2.accordion-header#faqHeading4
                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse4")
                  | What is a 'Bridge Clinic' in Spokane?
              #faqCollapse4.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby="faqHeading4" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion")
                .accordion-body
                  | A Bridge Clinic provides immediate initiation of medications like Suboxone to bridge the gap between a crisis and long-term treatment. Providence and CHAS Health offer these services in Spokane.

          hr.my-5

          // Conclusion
          h2#conclusion.mt-5
            i.bi.bi-sun.text-warning.me-2
            | You are not alone in Spokane
          p You can find a better way to live. Many people utilizing 
            strong fentanyl addiction treatment Spokane
            |  services have successfully claimed their lives back. There are free tools and kind people waiting for your call.

          .card.border-0.shadow.text-center.p-5.my-5(style="border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d6efd11 0%, #19875422 100%);")
